{"seq":1,"slug":"defect-grading-repair-scrap-decision","title":"坏件分级判定与维修报废决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/defective-reverse-repair/defect-grading-repair-scrap-decision","wordCount":3025,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"坏件分级判定与维修报废决策\">坏件分级判定与维修报废决策</h1><p>一件设备摆在检验台上时，挂着三套互相冲突的标签：买家说&quot;完全坏了&quot;，物流记录显示外壳有磕碰，序列号查出来是两年前的批次、原厂备件已经停产。此刻要做的不是&quot;修&quot;或&quot;不修&quot;的二选一，而是<strong>先分级、再分流</strong>：归入某个可复现的成色与功能档位，再按档位在&quot;翻新再售、降级再售、拆件入库、报废处置&quot;四条路里选一条净收益最高的。分级判错，后面所有动作都建立在错误的成本假设上——把能翻新的件报废是白扔钱，把该报废的件硬修是往无底洞里续人力。本文聚焦<strong>坏件回流维修</strong>这一环的第一条决策：<strong>分级标准与维修/报废的经济判定</strong>；RMA 授权与好件出库的前半程见同章 <a href=\"../rma-goodparts-outbound/rma-intake-authorization-eligibility\">RMA 受理与授权资格判定模型</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>坏件分级的本质是<strong>把连续、模糊的&quot;损坏程度&quot;离散成有限的处置档位</strong>，让每个档位对应一条固定的处置流水线和一套固定的成本/收益模型。分级至少有两根正交的轴：<strong>功能轴</strong>（能不能工作、坏了哪个子系统）与<strong>成色轴</strong>（外观、磨损、附件完整度）。二者不能压成一个分数——功能完好但碎屏的机器可换壳后当&quot;翻新 A 级&quot;卖，外观如新但主板进水的机器只能拆件。跨境还加了两条本地没有的约束：<strong>处置地与销售地可能不同</strong>（坏件在目的国回收、翻新在低人力成本地区做、成品再出口到第三国），判定要同时考虑两段运费、关税与再出口合规；<strong>合规决定哪些档位合法</strong>，含电池的件、含数据的存储介质在欧盟等法域有强制处置路径。判定的时序是单向收敛链：收货登记 → 检测 → 定级 → 经济分流 → 执行处置；判据不清晰时坏件就会积压成&quot;待定&quot;黑箱，这正是逆向物流成本失控的常见起点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[回收坏件到检&lt;br/&gt;序列号+故障码+外观记录] --&gt; B[检测&lt;br/&gt;目检 / 功能测试 / 深度诊断]&#10;    B --&gt; C{功能轴判定}&#10;    C --&gt;|功能正常| D1[成色轴判定&lt;br/&gt;外观+附件完整度]&#10;    C --&gt;|单模块失效| D2[可修复性判定&lt;br/&gt;换件是否可得]&#10;    C --&gt;|主板级/进水/结构损伤| D3[高风险档]&#10;    D1 --&gt; E[翻新/清洁/换壳]&#10;    D2 --&gt; F{经济阈值 BER}&#10;    D3 --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|修复净收益为正| G[维修]&#10;    F --&gt;|修复净收益为负| H[拆件入库&lt;br/&gt;良品件回收]&#10;    H --&gt; I[剩余残体报废&lt;br/&gt;合规处置]&#10;    G --&gt; J[翻新件重新入良品库]&#10;    E --&gt; J\">graph TD\n    A[回收坏件到检&lt;br/&gt;序列号+故障码+外观记录] --&gt; B[检测&lt;br/&gt;目检 / 功能测试 / 深度诊断]\n    B --&gt; C{功能轴判定}\n    C --&gt;|功能正常| D1[成色轴判定&lt;br/&gt;外观+附件完整度]\n    C --&gt;|单模块失效| D2[可修复性判定&lt;br/&gt;换件是否可得]\n    C --&gt;|主板级/进水/结构损伤| D3[高风险档]\n    D1 --&gt; E[翻新/清洁/换壳]\n    D2 --&gt; F{经济阈值 BER}\n    D3 --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|修复净收益为正| G[维修]\n    F --&gt;|修复净收益为负| H[拆件入库&lt;br/&gt;良品件回收]\n    H --&gt; I[剩余残体报废&lt;br/&gt;合规处置]\n    G --&gt; J[翻新件重新入良品库]\n    E --&gt; J</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置路径</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>收益来源</th>\n<th>主要成本</th>\n<th>合规约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>翻新再售</td>\n<td>功能完好或单模块可换</td>\n<td>二手成品售价</td>\n<td>清洁/换壳/再包装/认证</td>\n<td>需符合再售地标签与安全法规</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维修后归良品库</td>\n<td>可修复且 BER 通过</td>\n<td>省下新备件采购价</td>\n<td>人工 + 备件 + 双向物流</td>\n<td>维修件质保责任归属</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拆件入库</td>\n<td>整机不可修但单件可用</td>\n<td>良品件拆解价值</td>\n<td>拆解人工 + 检测工时</td>\n<td>拆件不得冒充新件销售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>材料回收/报废</td>\n<td>无可用件或高环境风险</td>\n<td>金属/塑料回收残值</td>\n<td>合规处置费（可能为负）</td>\n<td>WEEE、电池、数据擦除、巴塞尔公约</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>四条路的差别不只是收益高低，而是<strong>成本结构的方向</strong>：前两条是&quot;投入换回更高价值的产品&quot;，后两条是&quot;承认损失并回收残值&quot;；判定要在同一时点比较<strong>净收益</strong>，而非&quot;修好了值多少钱&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"检测与分级-从目检到功能测试的分层\">检测与分级：从目检到功能测试的分层</h2><p>分级的第一步是<strong>决定测多深</strong>：测得太浅会漏掉隐性故障（修好后在买家手里再坏一次，代价是二次退货加深信损失），测得太深则把工时推高到超过设备残值。可行做法是<strong>分层检测</strong>——低成本项全检、高成本项按触发条件升级，典型四层是：<strong>目检</strong>（外观、屏幕、进液指示、拆痕）、<strong>基础功能测试</strong>（开机、充电、显示、触摸、射频粗测，可用治具批量并行）、<strong>全功能诊断</strong>（读日志与电池健康度，测传感器与无线模块，暴露间歇性故障）、<strong>拆解级诊断</strong>（对进水、跌落、主板故障的件拆开确认换模块还是整板报废）。</p>\n<p>档位命名必须<strong>可复现且可审计</strong>——同一设备由不同检验员分到不同档等于模型失效。业界再售平台普遍用 4~5 档成色描述（如 Amazon 的 Renewed、Used–Like New、Used–Very Good、Used–Good、Used–Acceptable 分级，<a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GHBQ3THHHMS8DGDX），跨境翻新件常沿用这套语言以便上架时映射平台类目。分级结果必须**落成结构化数据**：序列号、故障码、功能轴与成色轴结论、拆修痕迹、判定档位与检验员——这是修复率、报废率等统计的底座，也是纠纷仲裁的证据。\">https://www.amazon.com/gp/help/customer/display.html?nodeId=GHBQ3THHHMS8DGDX），跨境翻新件常沿用这套语言以便上架时映射平台类目。分级结果必须**落成结构化数据**：序列号、故障码、功能轴与成色轴结论、拆修痕迹、判定档位与检验员——这是修复率、报废率等统计的底座，也是纠纷仲裁的证据。</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"维修-报废的经济阈值-ber-与修复级别分析\">维修-报废的经济阈值：BER 与修复级别分析</h2><p>经济分流的经典工具是<strong>维修级别分析（Level of Repair Analysis, LORA）</strong>：在给定维护层级与成本结构下，决定一个故障单元是&quot;就地修、送修、还是更换&quot;，航空与国防装备维修长期使用这套方法（Wikipedia, <em>Level of repair analysis</em>, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Level_of_repair_analysis）。移植到消费电子逆向物流，其核心量是**经济修复阈值（BER\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Level_of_repair_analysis）。移植到消费电子逆向物流，其核心量是**经济修复阈值（BER</a>, Beyond Economic Repair）<strong>：把&quot;修&quot;和&quot;换/报废&quot;放在同一坐标系里比较</strong>净收益**。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>refurb</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{refurb}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refurb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为修复后翻新件净售价，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{repair}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为备件加人工的维修直接成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为逆向段物流成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{harvest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harvest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为拆件所得良品件价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{disposal}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为报废合规处置费（可为负残值），则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>refurb</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{repair}} = V_{\\text{refurb}} - C_{\\text{repair}} - C_{\\text{rt}}, \\qquad N_{\\text{harvest}} = V_{\\text{harvest}} - C_{\\text{rt}} - C_{\\text{disposal}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refurb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harvest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span cl