\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{repair}} &gt; N_{\\text{harvest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harvest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时选维修，否则转拆件/报废。实务中常简化为 BER 比率做快速筛选：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>refurb</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = (C_{\\text{repair}} + C_{\\text{rt}}) / V_{\\text{refurb}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refurb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\le \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 时判为可修。阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 随件类别与策略变化：高值、长提前期的件（备件难买）可放宽到 0.6~0.7，因为&quot;能修&quot;本身避免了长交期缺货；低值、易采购的件应压到 0.4 以下，因为直接换新更快更省。<strong>这正是分级档位与库存分层挂钩之处</strong>：同一台设备在&quot;高值致命慢速&quot;层里值得修，在&quot;低值可选快速&quot;层里不值得。\n跨境场景让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rt</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{rt}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">rt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{repair}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的结构与本地完全不同。<strong>地域差</strong>：翻新人工在低人力成本地区可能只有目的国的几分之一，会把大量&quot;在目的国不值得修&quot;的件变成&quot;值得运回翻新&quot;的件，阈值必须与<strong>处置地选择</strong>联合求解。<strong>双段结构</strong>：坏件出口加翻新品再出口/内销，两段运费与关税都要计入。<strong>关税与退税</strong>：符合条件的再进口可能适用关税退还或暂准进口机制，会实质性改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{repair}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的符号——见同章 <a href=\"../spare-parts-network-layout/crossborder-spare-transfer-bonded-stock\">跨境备件调拨与保税库存</a>。一个常见错误是<strong>用修复成本与整机新品售价之比</strong>做 BER，正确分母应是<strong>翻新件净售价</strong>；新品售价常高于翻新品数倍，用新品做分母会系统性高估阈值、把本可修复的件误判为报废。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报废与合规-数据擦除-weee-电池与巴塞尔公约\">报废与合规：数据擦除、WEEE、电池与巴塞尔公约</h2><p>报废不是&quot;扔掉&quot;，而是一条受多重法规约束的处置链。<strong>数据擦除</strong>：含存储介质的设备离开管控前必须完成清除并留可审计证据，NIST SP 800-88 Rev.1《Guidelines for Media Sanitization》把清除分为 Clear（标准读写命令覆盖）、Purge（对抗实验室级恢复）、Destroy（物理销毁）三档（NIST, <a href=\"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/88/r1/final）；能再售的走\">https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/88/r1/final）；能再售的走</a> Purge、要报废的走 Destroy，且必须在二次销售前完成。<strong>废弃与电池</strong>：欧盟 WEEE 指令（Directive 2012/19/EU, <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2012/19/oj）要求报废电子设备走生产者责任延伸（EPR）体系、由合规回收商处理并留记录；含锂离子电池的坏件运输受危险品规则约束、报废受欧盟电池法规（Regulation\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dir/2012/19/oj）要求报废电子设备走生产者责任延伸（EPR）体系、由合规回收商处理并留记录；含锂离子电池的坏件运输受危险品规则约束、报废受欧盟电池法规（Regulation</a> (EU) 2023/1542, <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/oj）约束。**跨境转移**：电子废料的跨国转移受《巴塞尔公约》（https://www.basel.int/）及其电子废物修正约束，某些废料被限制或禁止出口——这与&quot;把坏件运回低人力成本地区翻新&quot;直接冲突，**只有被认定为可修复的整机/部件**通常才可跨境流动，纯废料则受限，因此分级阶段就要把&quot;待修件&quot;与&quot;废料&quot;分开。\">https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/1542/oj）约束。**跨境转移**：电子废料的跨国转移受《巴塞尔公约》（https://www.basel.int/）及其电子废物修正约束，某些废料被限制或禁止出口——这与&quot;把坏件运回低人力成本地区翻新&quot;直接冲突，**只有被认定为可修复的整机/部件**通常才可跨境流动，纯废料则受限，因此分级阶段就要把&quot;待修件&quot;与&quot;废料&quot;分开。</a></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>报废前检查项</th>\n<th>判定依据</th>\n<th>未通过的后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据是否已清除</td>\n<td>NIST SP 800-88 Clear/Purge/Destroy</td>\n<td>数据泄露、合规处罚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否属 EPR 管控</td>\n<td>WEEE / 各国 EPR 登记</td>\n<td>罚款、平台下架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>含电池运输资质</td>\n<td>危险品运输规则</td>\n<td>扣货、承运人拒收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否属受限跨境废料</td>\n<td>巴塞尔公约及目的国法规</td>\n<td>海关扣押、退运</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回收商资质</td>\n<td>R2v3 / e-Stewards 等认证</td>\n<td>记录不达标、审计失败</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对负残值件（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>disposal</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{harvest}} &lt; C_{\\text{disposal}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harvest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disposal</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），经济上&quot;贴着钱处理&quot;是正常的；把它藏起来不做处置则是把一项已知成本转成一项未知的合规风险。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级决策的运营指标与反馈闭环\">分级决策的运营指标与反馈闭环</h2><p>分级判定的质量必须用量化指标持续校准，否则档位会随检验员经验漂移。<strong>修复率</strong>（判定可修且修复成功件数 / 送检坏件总数）与<strong>报废率</strong>（判为报废件数 / 送检坏件总数）度量处置结构的健康度，<strong>分级准确率</strong>（复核与首判一致件数 / 被复核件数）靠抽样独立复判来测，而把全文成本模型收成一个可对标数字的是<strong>回收净值率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>回收净值率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mtext>退件账面原值</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{回收净值率} = \\frac{\\sum_i V_i - \\sum_i C_i}{\\text{退件账面原值}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回收净值率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1257em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4397em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">退件账面原值</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6897em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母用退件账面原值，直接反映&quot;每一块钱的退货资产最后捞回了多少&quot;。这套指标的价值不止于考核处置效率，更在于<strong>回流到正向端</strong>：坏件的故障码分布是产品可靠性的真实信号——某批次某故障码异常集中指向设计或供应链问题，某类备件在拆件档频率异常高则指向该备件的正向定价或库存策略。分级不只是向下游输出的环节，它同时是正向决策的反馈传感器，把数据接回正向系统，逆向网络才不只是成本中心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>坏件分级是<strong>先分级、再分流</strong>：把连续的损坏程度离散成有限处置档位，每个档位对应固定流水线与成本模型。</li>\n<li>分级至少两根正交轴——功能轴与成色轴；压成单一分数会丢失&quot;功能好但外观差&quot;与&quot;外观好但进水&quot;两种相反处置的件。- 检测分层：目检 → 基础功能 → 全功能诊断 → 拆解级诊断，按成本与触发条件逐级升级，避免漏检与过度检测。</li>\n<li>经济分流用 BER：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>repair</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{repair}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">repair</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>harvest</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{harvest}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harvest</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 比较；简化比率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\le \\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 随件类别与策略变化，分母必须是<strong>翻新件净售价</strong>而非新品售价。</li>\n<li>跨境的两段物流成本与处置地人力差会翻转判定，&quot;修不修&quot;与&quot;在哪修&quot;必须联合求解。</li>\n<li>报废受数据擦除（NIST SP 800-88）、WEEE、欧盟电池法规与巴塞尔公约约束；分级阶段就要区分&quot;待修件&quot;与&quot;废料&quot;。</li>\n<li>用修复率、报废率、分级准确率、回收净值率持续校准档位，并把故障码数据反馈回正向品控与备件策略。\n本文给出分级与分流的经济判据；其良品件如何重新计入库存、维修件如何继承质保责任，是本章后续两篇的主题。返回 <a href=\"./\">本章索引</a>，或续读 <a href=\"../rma-goodparts-outbound/rma-intake-authorization-eligibility\">RMA 受理与授权资格判定模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"坏件分级判定与维修报废决策","id":"坏件分级判定与维修报废决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"检测与分级：从目检到功能测试的分层","id":"检测与分级-从目检到功能测试的分层"},{"level":2,"text":"维修-报废的经济阈值：BER 与修复级别分析","id":"维修-报废的经济阈值-ber-与修复级别分析"},{"level":2,"text":"报废与合规：数据擦除、WEEE、电池与巴塞尔公约","id":"报废与合规-数据擦除-weee-电池与巴塞尔公约"},{"level":2,"text":"分级决策的运营指标与反馈闭环","id":"分级决策的运营指标与反馈闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RMA 关税退税与发出异常处置","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/rma-goodparts-outbound/rma-duty-drawback-exception"},"next":{"title":"维修工单排程与备件消耗联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/spare-parts-rma-reverse-network/defective-reverse-repair/repair-workorder-scheduling-part-consumption"}}